SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ Ted Riskin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, May 17th\n1st Dance Wa
 ve 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wave
  10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ \\| Facili
 tator Ted Riskin\n\nIntention: Let go of the banana!\n\nYou may have heard
  the parable of a simple way to catch monkeys in the jungle. Leave a banan
 a in a container with an opening large enough for the monkey’s hand\, bu
 t small enough that it can’t remove its hand while grasping the banana. 
 Even as a hunter approaches\, the monkey won’t release the banana so it 
 can escape.\n\nWhat is the banana that is keeping you stuck because you wo
 n’t let it go? Approval or acceptance of your lifestyle choices from a p
 arent? Permission to set a boundary? Needing to prove your point or win th
 e argument?\nYou are invited to release some bananas in Sunday’s dance a
 nd grieve their loss.\n\nAbout the Facilitator \\| DJ\nTed Riskin is inter
 ested in anything that can get him out of his head\, and music and movemen
 t do a pretty good job of that. He hopes to offer music that facilitates a
 n inner journey and invitations that create a shift. While he likes modern
  electronic music\, he can’t create a mix without including lots of natu
 ral instruments and voices. Due to a short attention span\, he mixes in lo
 ts of different musical genres. You can hear some of his mixes on [mixclou
 d.com/tarisk](https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fmixcloud.com%2Ft
 arisk%3Ffbclid%3DIwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExWnljNDduN1JYdHRHdWZPV3NydGMGYXB
 wX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR66DepJRBJZtIsaTVJk_6je81XOO6m9AuXnlW6AR6AKS
 24tAwyvNjqlUaO0ng_aem_9XCEsGxjIS0Ptvgq2REWTw&h=AUBK_PQ7b3YkrFgMTL7y4udVTGF
 OJeMvtBMT4GvK0Au3WDB9dX01Yg0wEKHyq8DEdPQ_vee-x5OnKy5gpn6EE9mE1xZDGK5QL29DM
 zHEyFsEPn4GkKI0qMl_rUMVWZ2Tml5Qnhpo-OclJ-DYUWEpwWUEDNgvLWH9pA&__tn__=q&c[0
 ]=AUChFL_OfgTVUHIKN6Uxvtvy3Tqe75MtoM6C_LzNq8YeULxy2TRuBdi_HUSiNLThgYysYCpK
 p6L3Z7t6pv74yTTE9XYnZqIrwTsvHZc5OS2_qqypimBYnpQKM00jqLl6r5hfb2FHNjlXjaXNem
 UZogA-Als3eMt-P0s).\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance star
 ts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and people who a
 rrive late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and sec
 ure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your price.\nNo one 
 turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration Recommende
 d:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need 
 volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at: [https
 ://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementco
 llective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM
 3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4rMD5vM_RH
 t9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPORTANT A
 NNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Ple
 ase note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreemen
 ts:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevill
 emovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aE
 xURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bGlkEsU_C
 g_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCcIA)\n\n
 About AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in 
 harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving co
 mmunity. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy commu
 nity through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and commu
 nity transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nSee you
  on the dance floor!
