SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ Sara Bensman
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, May 22nd\nEvening Danc
 e Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nFacil
 itator \\| DJ Sara Bensman\n\nIntention: Shapeshifters\n\nDaylight\, full 
 of small dancing particles\nand the one great turning\, our souls\nare dan
 cing with you\, without feet\, they dance.\nCan you see them when I whispe
 r in your ear?\n-Rumi\n\nGnosis\, the knowing that comes from experience\,
  from fully understanding something from the inside out\, transforms our s
 oul\, and opens us to empathy\, connection and a sense of oneness. To know
  something physical\, such as a river or a coat\, we must try it on\, enve
 lope ourselves in its texture\, form\, scent and movement. Our ancestors b
 ecame the lion\, the eagle or the willow tree through the transformational
  magic of trance in order to know how a lion hunts\, an eagle sees\, or a 
 willow bends\, but also simply to know those beings. This shapeshifting da
 nce is an invitation to explore the essences of others in order find ourse
 lves within our "family of things."\n\nAbout the DJ Sara Bensman\nSara’s
  mix-making arises from musical exploration. She seeks to understand energ
 y through somatic responses to sonic vibrations. Her facilitation is prope
 lled by a desire to help build and sustain community by creating a safe\, 
 loving container for self-expression\, connection and release. If you’d 
 like to listen to her sets visit [https://soundcloud.com/sara-bensman](htt
 ps://soundcloud.com/sara-bensman?utm_id=97758_v0_s00_e232_tv4_tp1_a1demo0e
 19glu6&fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExcHFZQVpndjFWSGkyZXBmOXNydGMGYXBwX2
 lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6UkzN9fc5ogNGNOxolUDp8OIHnBk9DzPhRz34zUfZhtgkQ
 FHCIOrRm1BmO3g_aem_R4ODBrHixyvsYn3mjU3Ibw)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please n
 ote that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening 
 Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to en
 sure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name
  your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Re
 commended:\n\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../](h
 ttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZ
 W0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTI
 AAR60jGoPctQmZENEP-6g1PiLerpr4LJLC5heP1Rn7TgedmIne3f6mes9kn3Wnw_aem_ASPUsp
 eNro8PjxFCFjEUGg)\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance f
 or free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.o
 rg/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=I
 wZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3O
 DgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_
 aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close a
 t the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING
  CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementc
 ollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-danc
 e/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkED
 IyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELh
 DttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement C
 ollective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be
  their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are
  to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by 
 hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 50
 1(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 2
 8805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
