SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ Rory Jagdeo
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, May 24th\n1st Dance Wa
 ve 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wave
  10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ \\| Facili
 tator Rory Jagdeo\n\nIntention: Embracing Life\n\nToday I will Embrace Lif
 e:\nTomorrow is not certain\nAll I have is today\nThe present\, the now\nT
 his moment in time\nTo live\, to love\nTo experience life as it comes\nTo 
 feel the essence of living\nAs I live each day\nIn the fullness of time\nT
 oday I will embrace life\nNudershada Cabanes\n\nAbout the DJ\nRory Jagdeo 
 is a singer/songwriter and an AMC Facilitator. He stepped into Ecstatic Da
 nce in Houston\, TX for the first time in 2014 and believes in the power o
 f dance to transform and bring a healthier\, happier\, and connected lifes
 tyle. It is that driving force and passion that pushes him to explore the 
 role of being an Ecstatic Dance Facilitator using world rhythms and differ
 ent musical genres to weave mixes that incorporate many elements of 8Rhyth
 ms. Listen to his mixes at: [https://soundcloud.com/roryjagdeo](https://so
 undcloud.com/roryjagdeo?utm_id=97758_v0_s00_e232_tv4_tp1_a1demo0e19glu6&fb
 clid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExWnljNDduN1JYdHRHdWZPV3NydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjA
 zOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6RZUtWcERyDA9v8di55NAFqGAY622ULpUzWQCQP0iCQv_NpdYdVSnKG
 lxUfg_aem_R0pGqPB4KTN5xnheCBa4UA). And his music at: [https://roryjagdeo.b
 andcamp.com/releases](https://roryjagdeo.bandcamp.com/releases?fbclid=IwZX
 h0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExWnljNDduN1JYdHRHdWZPV3NydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgy
 MDA4OTIAAR4_qpRJSnPeH6LGZ-BQy2rX9w0Ae7ca8ZzkoxGkSQ2smpjrvGtA6phDgetbhg_aem
 _GonyYnX6dnCveqh1eO2QGw)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance
  starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and people 
 who arrive late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe an
 d secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Price: $15-30 or name your price.\nNo
  one turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration Recom
 mended:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe 
 need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at: [
 https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovem
 entcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExq
 bndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4rMD5
 vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPORT
 ANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle
 . Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agr
 eements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ash
 evillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExV
 TF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bGlk
 EsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCcIA
 )\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that move
 s in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a lovi
 ng community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy 
 community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and 
 community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nSe
