SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ Guest DJ Yaku Beat
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, June 5th\n\nEvening Da
 nce Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nGue
 st DJ Yaku Beat \\| Facilitator TBA\nIntention: TBA\n\nJosh Courtney/DJ Ya
 ku Beat (guest)\nYaku Beat channels the spirit of water - flowing\, cleans
 ing and alive. From a life in modern medicine\, entrepreneurship and fathe
 rhood\, to years on the sacred plant medicine path\, Josh’s evolution ha
 s spanned many worlds. Guided by an appetite for self-revelation\, his bea
 ts and live instrumentation will invite you into the depths of your most w
 ild and luminous heart.\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance 
 starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that
  come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and sec
 ure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo 
 one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\n[http
 s://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../](https://ashevillemov
 ementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZW
 Q0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR60jGoPctQmZENEP-
 6g1PiLerpr4LJLC5heP1Rn7TgedmIne3f6mes9kn3Wnw_aem_ASPUspeNro8PjxFCFjEUGg)\n
 VOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register t
